  "notes": "Cash basis county; only governmental funds (no business-type funds). Basic statements: p1 Statement of Net Position (report p5), p2 Statement of Activities, p3 fund assets/balances, p4 receipts/disbursements/changes statement (Total Governmental Funds column used). Taxes 13,109,842 split by fund column: Inheritance fund 1,744,110 as inheritance tax; remainder (General 11,155,229 + Nonmajor 210,503) left as taxes (unlabeled) because no tax-type breakdown is printed. Roll-forward reconciles: 26,868,014 + 23,173,307 - 23,516,673 + 7,281,731 - 7,281,731 = 26,524,648. Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p5) is the only General Fund schedule; major fund budget schedules (p6-8) give receipts by type but one disbursement line, so function assigned by fund (Road, Sinking: streets/highways; ROD Pres and Insurance: general government; Inheritance: culture/recreation per p4 columns), not itemized. Nonmajor funds have more than 6 funds so the combining statement Total Nonmajor column (p16) is used (more detailed than the nonmajor budget pages p9-12, which show only total receipts/disbursements per fund; those were not recorded to avoid double counting). General Fund 'Misc. - General Government' 3,514,867 equals p4 General Fund Culture and Recreation 3,514,867, so categorized culture/recreation; Child Support put in public safety and Noxious Weed/Surveyor in streets/highways to tie to the p4 General Fund function totals. COVID American Rescue Plan line (budget 5,627,218, actual dash) omitted as zero. Transfer cross-check: General Fund transfers out 6,731,731 = Road 2,800,000 + Road/Bridge Sinking 2,451,849 + Insurance 909,135 + nonmajor Community/Economic Development 150,000 + 911 Emergency Mgmt 207,068 + County Buildings 213,679; Inheritance out 500,000 = Federal Grant Fund in 500,000; COVID out 50,000 = Local Assistance in 50,000. Total in 7,281,731 = total out 7,281,731. Transfers are shown below the General Fund disbursement total and are not hidden in spending lines. No decision needed. Investments shown as a dash (zero), beginning balance from p4. Read pages 1-16 of 16 ROD Pres & Mod detail disbursements 8,369 (p7, one total line) mix capital outlay 4,470 and general government 3,899 per the p4 statement; categorized as the dominant capital outlay."
